  "title": "Daily Video Engagement Report with Zero-Fill",
  "prompt": "Your online course platform tracks daily video watch time per course. The marketing team needs a complete engagement report that shows EVERY day in March 2024 for EACH course, even if no videos were watched on a given day. Write a query that generates one row per (course_id, date) combination for all days from March 1 through March 14, 2024. For days with no watch activity, report 0 total minutes. Return columns: course_id, watch_date, total_minutes_watched. Order by course_id, watch_date. Use generate_series to create the complete date spine, CROSS JOIN it with the set of all course_ids, then LEFT JOIN the actual watch events and COALESCE missing values to 0.",
